sequenceDiagram
accTitle: One-way refresh becomes a controlled cutover
accDescr: The on-premises share remains authoritative during incremental copies, then a final copy follows a write freeze before FSx accepts writes.
participant S as On-premises SMB
participant D as DataSync
participant F as FSx for Windows
participant C as AWS clients
S->>D: Initial 1 TB copy
D->>F: Files and supported ACLs
loop Daily while source owns writes
S->>D: New and changed files
D->>F: Incremental task
C->>F: Read latest completed copy
end
Note over S,F: Freeze source writes for final transfer
S->>D: Final changes
D->>F: Transfer and verify
Note over F,C: Validate, then switch write ownership
C->>F: Read and write after cutover
